{"Color palette":"色盤","Lit tiles (every 5th) are safe: floats of any color share them and no captures happen there.":"點亮的圖塊（每 5 個）是安全的：任何顏色的浮標共享它們，並且不會發生捕獲。","After a full lap, floats climb their colored approach. The final crown needs an exact roll (unless bounce-back is on).":"完整一圈後，浮標爬上其顏色的進場通道。最終的王冠需要精確擲骰（除非開啟反彈）。","Tiles bearing a lit lantern are safe: floats of any color may rest there together, and no capture can happen.":"帶有點亮燈籠的瓦片是安全的：任何顏色的漂浮物都可以停在那裡，並且不會發生捕獲。","After a full lap, floats turn into their colored Grand Approach. Reach the pavilion crown with an exact roll.":"完整一圈後，浮標轉入其顏色的大進場通道。以精確擲骰到達亭閣王冠。","Player":"玩家","Crown {n} float(s)":"加冕 {n} 個浮標","{n} captures":"{n}捕獲","Win with {n}+ captures":"以 {n}+ 捕获获胜","Win without capturing":"無需捕獲即可獲勝","☁ synced":"☁ 已同步","☁ saving…":"☁ 儲存中…","☁ offline":"☁ 離線","Captions for meaningful audio":"重要音訊的字幕","Camera":"攝影機","Theme":"主題","Visual theme. Cosmetics never alter rules or hazards.":"視覺主題。化妆品永远不会改变规则或危害。","Pause":"暫停","Undo":"復原","Hint":"提示","Left-handed controls":"慣用左手控制","The CVD palette uses blue/gold separation; player identity also uses shapes and labels.":"CVD調色板使用藍色/金色分離；玩家身份也使用形狀和標籤。","Timing assistance (longer AI pauses, slower banners)":"計時輔助（AI 暫停時間較長，橫幅速度較慢）","Replay tutorial lessons":"重播教學課程","Auto":"自動","Top":"頂部","Low":"低","↺ Resume saved game":"↺ 恢復保存的遊戲","{n}/40 stages complete":"{n}/40級完成","40 festival stages":"40 個節慶關卡","One shared race each day":"每天一場共享比賽","Saved game restored.":"保存的遊戲已恢復。","Could not restore the saved game.":"無法恢復已保存的遊戲。","Practice Match":"練習賽","Daily Circuit":"每日賽道","Journey":"旅程","Challenge":"挑戰","Lesson":"課程","Local Table":"本地表","Set up":"設定","Players":"玩家","AI difficulty":"AI 難度","Floats per player":"每位玩家的浮點數","Rule variants":"規則變體","Exact finish (overshoot is wasted)":"精確完成（過衝被浪費）","Processions (blockades)":"遊行（封鎖）","Lantern safe tiles":"燈籠安全磁磚","Players at this table":"此桌的玩家","Pass-and-play: everyone shares this device. Undo is allowed between turns.":"傳遞即用：每個人共享該設備。回合之間允許撤銷。","~{n} min":"約 {n} 分鐘","{n} players":"{n} 位玩家","{level} AI":"{level}人工智慧","{n} floats each":"{n} 各自浮動","limit {n} rounds":"限制{n}輪數","no turn limit":"無回合限制","standard rules":"標準規則","scripted lesson dice":"脚本课程骰子","Rules:":"規則：","Expected duration:":"預計持續時間：","Ranked:":"排名：","Assists:":"協助：","{done} of 40 stages complete · {stars} stars":"已完成{done}／40關 · {stars}星","Stage {n}: {name}, {stars} stars":"第 {n} 關：{name}，{stars} 星","Stage {n}: {name}":"關卡 {n}：{name}","Stage {n}: {name}, locked":"第 {n} 關：{name}，已鎖定","Lesson {n}":"課程 {n}","best {score}":"最佳 {score}","No daily results yet — play today’s Daily Circuit.":"尚無每日結果 — 參加今天的每日巡迴賽。","No records yet — finish a journey stage, challenge or daily.":"尚無記錄 - 完成旅程階段、挑戰或每日。","Where":"哪裡","Result":"結果","Score":"分數","Turns":"轉動","Seed":"種子","Personal bests — these records live on this device and sync with your account; they are never submitted as ranked scores. Each row keeps its ruleset, content version, seed and duration; impossible scores are rejected before they are recorded.":"個人最佳成績 — 這些記錄保存在該設備上並與您的帳戶同步；它們永遠不會作為排名分數提交。每行保留其規則集、內容版本、種子和持續時間；不可能的分數在記錄之前就被拒絕了。","Casual board — these records are stored on this device only and are not submitted or compared against other players. Each row keeps its ruleset, content version, seed and duration; impossible scores are rejected before they are recorded.":"休閒棋盤——這些記錄僅儲存在此裝置上，不會提交或與其他玩家比較。每列保留其規則集、內容版本、種子與時長；不可能的分數會在記錄前被拒絕。","Loading the festival leaderboard…":"正在載入節慶排行榜...","No platform leaderboard for this board yet — personal bests above are the record.":"該板還沒有平台排行榜 - 以上個人最佳成績是記錄。","Festival leaderboard":"節慶排行榜","Display name":"顯示名稱","Name saved.":"名稱已儲存。","Games:":"遊戲：","Won:":"贏得：","Captures:":"捕捉：","Floats crowned:":"花車加冕：","Daily streak:":"每日連勝：","{n} day(s)":"{n} 天","Account:":"帳戶：","Signed in via the platform — progress syncs to your account ({status}). This device keeps an offline copy.":"透過平台登入 — 進度同步到您的帳戶 ({status})。該設備保留離線副本。","Erase all local progress":"清除所有本機進度","Erase all local progress, settings stay. This cannot be undone.":"擦除所有本地進度，保留設定。此操作無法撤銷。","Progress erased.":"進度已清除。","Race four floats from your workshop around the Grand Circuit. A full lap earns the right to climb your Grand Approach — crown all four floats in the pavilion to win.":"從你的工作室派出四輛花車繞大賽道比賽。跑完一圈即可獲得攀登 Grand Approach 的權利——將展館內的所有四個花車加冕即可獲勝。","Kindling":"點火","Roll a 6 to move a float from the workshop onto your start tile. A 6 also grants an encore roll — but three 6s in a row are overkindled and end your turn.":"投擲 6 即可將車間中的花車移到起始板塊上。 6 也可以進行一次安可檢定－但連續三個 6 會過度點燃並結束你的回合。","Lantern tiles":"燈籠磚","Captures":"捕獲","Land exactly on a rival float on an ordinary tile to send it back to its workshop.":"準確地落在普通瓷磚上的競爭對手浮標上，將其送回其車間。","Processions":"遊行","Two of your floats on one ordinary tile form a wall: rivals can neither land on it nor pass it.":"一块普通瓷砖上的两个浮标形成一堵墙：对手既不能降落在上面也不能通过它。","The Approach":"此方法","Controls":"控制","{confirm} roll/confirm · arrows switch float · {undo} undo · {hint} hint · {camera} camera · {board} board text · {pause} pause. Gamepad: ✕/A confirm, ○/B cancel, ☰ pause.":"{confirm} 擲骰／確認 · 方向鍵切換棋子 · {undo} 復原 · {hint} 提示 · {camera} 鏡頭 · {board} 棋盤文字 · {pause} 暫停。遊戲手把：✕/A 確認，○/B 取消，☰ 暫停。","Achievement unlocked: {name}":"已解鎖成就：{name}","Journey {n}":"旅程 {n}","Practice":"練習","Be first to crown {n} float(s).":"率先加冕 {n} 個浮標。","First to {n} captures wins the stage.":"首先以{n}佔領者獲勝。","Win the race with at least {n} captures.":"以至少 {n} 捕获赢得比赛。","Win without capturing any rival float.":"在不捕获任何对手浮标的情况下获胜。","Crown all your floats first. Lantern schedule: {n} rounds.":"先加冕你所有的浮標。燈籠時程表：{n} 輪。","Crown all your floats first.":"先加冕你所有的浮標。","{n}-round limit":"{n}-回合限制","No turn limit":"無回合限制","{name} begins — roll!":"{name} 开始——滚！","Your turn — roll!":"轮到你了——滚！","{name} to roll…":"{name} 滚动……","No moves — you must pass.":"無步可走——你必須跳過。","{name} has no moves.":"{name}没有动作。","Rolled {n} — choose a float.":"軋製 {n} — 選擇浮動。","{name} is choosing…":"{name} 正在选择……","Flo