ved and can be resumed.":"退出遊戲？單人進度已儲存並可恢復。","That float cannot use this roll.":"该浮体无法使用该骰子。","Today: won · score {score}":"今天：获胜·得分{score}","Today: played · score {score}":"今天：打過·得分{score}","exact finish":"精確完成","bounce finish":"彈跳完成","processions on":"遊行","no processions":"沒有遊行","lantern tiles":"燈籠磚","dark circuit":"暗電路","no safe tiles":"沒有安全磁磚","yes — counts for records":"是 — 計入記錄","no — practice does not affect rating":"否 — 练习不影响评级","hints available, undo allowed":"可用提示，允許撤銷","hints available":"可用提示","Won":"已獲勝","Lost":"失敗","Exact finish at the crown":"冠部的精確光潔度","Bounce-back finish":"反彈完成","Processions block rivals":"遊行阻擋對手","No processions":"沒有遊行","Lantern tiles are safe":"燈籠磚是安全的","No safe tiles":"沒有安全磁磚","Captures on":"捕捉開啟","Captures off":"捕捉關閉","Victory":"勝利","Game over":"遊戲結束","Race your floats around the festival circuit. First to crown all four wins.":"你的花車在節慶賽道上競速。第一個獲得全部四場勝利的人。","▶ Play":"▶ 開始","Learn":"學習","Interactive lessons":"互動課程","Unranked, undo allowed":"不計排名，允許復原","Challenges":"挑戰","Constrained goals":"受限目標","Profile":"個人檔案","Achievements":"成就","Leaderboards":"排行榜","How to Play":"玩法說明","Settings":"設定","Back":"返回","Start":"開始","Learn the Circuit":"學習電路","Board state (accessible text)":"棋盤狀態（無障礙文字）","Objective":"目標","Turn":"回合","Progress":"進度","Rules":"規則","Roll the festival die":"滾節死","Roll":"擲骰","Pass":"跳過回合","Paused":"已暫停","Resume":"繼續","Restart":"重新開始","Leave Game":"離開遊戲","Done":"完成","Audio":"音訊","Graphics":"圖形","Accessibility":"協助工具","Results":"結果","Watch Replay":"觀看重播","Retry":"重試","Close":"關閉","Daily":"每日","All-time":"歷史記錄","Board State":"棋盤狀態","Are you sure?":"你確定嗎？","Cancel":"取消","Confirm":"確認","Lantern Pavilion":"燈籠亭","Jade Garden":"翡翠花園","Ember Court":"餘燼庭院","Moonlight Dock":"月光碼頭","Blossom Fête":"花開慶典","Kindling a Float":"點燃漂浮物","Your floats begin in the workshop. Roll a 6 — a full kindle — to send one onto the circuit. The festival die is scripted for this lesson.":"你的花车从车间开始。掷 6（完整的 kindle）即可将一个送入赛道。节日模具是为本课程编写的。","Roll the festival die.":"滾節死。","You rolled a 6! Choose a float to kindle it onto your start tile.":"你掷出了 6！选择一个漂浮物将其点燃到您的起始图块上。","Well done — a kindled float also grants an encore roll.":"幹得好－點燃的浮標還可以進行安可捲。","Around the Circuit":"環繞賽道","Floats travel the full circuit. Your rival will take turns with you.":"浮標行進整個迴路。你的對手會輪流和你一起。","Roll the die.":"擲骰子。","Kindle a float onto the circuit.":"將浮子點燃到電路上。","Encore! Roll again.":"再來一次！再滾一次。","Move your float along the circuit.":"沿著電路移動浮子。","Your rival now takes a turn. Turns alternate unless a 6 grants an encore.":"你的對手現在輪到你了。轮流交替，除非 6 允许加演。","Lantern Tiles":"燈籠磁磚","A rival float waits on the lantern tile ahead. Roll.":"一個對手的浮標在前方的燈籠格等待。擲骰。","Move onto the lantern tile — you will share it peacefully.":"移至燈籠圖塊上 — 您將和平地分享它。","See? Both floats share the lantern tile. Safe tiles never capture.":"看到了嗎？兩個花車共用燈籠瓦。安全磁磚永遠不會捕獲。","The Capture":"捕獲","Land on a rival float on an ordinary tile to send it all the way back to its workshop.":"落在一塊普通瓷磚上的競爭對手的漂浮物上，將其一路送回其車間。","A rival float rests three tiles ahead, unguarded. Roll.":"一個對手的浮標停在前方三格，無人防守。擲骰。","Land exactly on it to send it home!":"準確地落在它上面，將它送回家！","Captured! Rival floats return to their workshop and must be kindled again.":"被捕獲！敵方浮體返回其工坊，必須重新點燃。","Two of your floats on one ordinary tile form a procession. Rivals can neither land on it nor pass it.":"一块普通瓷砖上的两个花车形成一个游行队伍。对手既不能登陆也不能越过它。","Roll, then bring your floats together.":"滾動，然後將漂浮物放在一起。","Move the rear float onto its companion (tile 6).":"將後浮子移到其同伴上（圖塊 6）。","A procession! Now roll again for your rival to feel it… actually, feel free to move on.":"一個隊列！現在再次滾動，讓你的對手感受一下……其實，你可以繼續前進了。","Move any float. Remember: rivals cannot cross your procession.":"移動任何浮動。請記住：競爭對手無法跨越您的隊伍。","Processions are walls. Break yours up when it blocks your own plans.":"遊行隊伍是牆。當你的計劃阻礙了你的計劃時，就分手吧。","The Grand Approach":"大方法","Your float is on the approach, three steps from the crown. Roll.":"您的浮标已接近，距离顶部三步。卷。","An exact 3 — guide it to the crown!":"正好3——把它引導到皇冠！","Crowned! Crown all four floats to sweep the circuit and win.":"加冕！加冕所有四個浮標以橫掃賽道並獲勝。","First Lanterns":"第一個燈籠","Open Causeway":"開放堤道","Rival at Dusk":"黃昏的對手","Double Time":"雙倍時間","Mastery: Kindling":"精通：點燃","Lantern Watch":"燈籠表","Shared Shelter":"共享庇護所","First Blood":"首殺","Escort Duty":"護衛任務","Mastery: Shelter":"精通：庇護所","Two Deep":"雙深","The Long Wall":"長牆","Breakthrough":"突破","Wall and Blade":"牆和刀片","Mastery: Processions":"精通：遊行","Home Stretch":"最後衝刺","Exact Measure":"精確測量","Bounce Step":"彈跳步","Bounce-back finish: overshoot reflects down the approach.":"反彈完成：過衝沿著接近路徑反射下來。","Crown Guard":"王冠守衛","Win by captures: send three rival floats home first.":"以捕獲獲勝：首先將三個對手彩車送回家。","Mastery: The Approach":"精通：方法","Three Lamps":"三盞燈","A strict lantern schedule: finish before the turn limit.":"嚴格的燈籠時間表：在回合限制前完成。","Crossroads":"十字路口","Encore Line":"安可線","Festival Rush":"節慶高峰","Mastery: Three Ways":"精通：三種方式","Short Circuit":"短路","Fewer floats, tighter schedule.":"花車更少，時間表更緊。","Swift Crown":"迅捷皇冠","Tight Reins":"勒緊韁繩","Twin Floats":"雙浮子","Mastery: Economy":"精通：經濟","Four Lamps":"四盞燈","Crowded Ring":"擁擠的環","No Shelter":"沒有庇護所","The lanterns are dark — nowhere is safe.":"灯笼很黑——没有地方是安全的。","Long Night":"長夜","Mastery: Grand Fête":"精通：盛大節日","Ember Trial":"餘燼試煉","The final trials of the Royal Circuit.":"皇家巡迴賽的最終選拔賽。","Jade Trial":"玉試煉","Azure Trial":"蔚藍試煉","Gilded Trial":"鍍金審判","Mastery: Royal Circuit":"精通：皇家賽道","Lantern Sprint":"燈籠衝刺","Win in 24 rounds or fewer. Every roll must count.":"在24輪或更少的時間內獲勝。每卷都必須算數。","Pacifist Parade":"和平主義遊行","Win without capturing a single rival float.":"在不捕获任何对手的情况下获胜。","Float Hunter":"漂浮獵人","Land at least 5 captures on the way to victory.":"至少完成 5 次捕獲才能獲得勝利。","Photo Finish":"壓線取勝","Bounce-back rules against a master rival. Overshoots reflect.":"對抗大師級對手的反彈規則。過衝會反射。","Dark Circuit":"暗電路","No lantern tiles. Every tile is dangerous.":"沒有燈籠瓷磚。每一塊磁磚都是危險的。","Grand Melee":"大混戰","Four master floats, one circuit, fifty rounds.":"四輛主花車，一圈，五十輪。","First Crown":"首頂皇冠","Crown your first float.":"加冕你的第一個浮標。","Circuit Victor":"環線勝者","Win your first game.":"贏得你的第一場遊戲。","Lantern Snuffer":"燈籠扼殺者","Land 10 captures in total.":"總共捕獲10塊土地。","Pilgrim of the Ring":"指環朝聖者","Complete 20 journey stages.":"完成 20 個旅程關卡。","Master of the Circuit":"電路大師","Complete all 40 journey stages.":"完成所有 40 個旅程關卡。","Three Dusks Running":"三个黄昏奔跑","Play the daily challenge 3 days in a row.":"連續三天進行每日挑戰。","Untouchable":"無法觸及","Win a game without any float being sent home.":"在沒有任何浮標被送回家的情況下贏得一場比賽。","Festival Scholar":"節慶學者","Complete every lesson.":"完成每堂課。","Hundred Circuits":"百個電路","Complete 100 games across any mode. (Counts every mode equally — no grind advantage.)":"在任何模式下完成 100 場遊戲。（每種模式均等計算——沒有刷分優勢。）","Casual":"休閒","Paper Crane":"紙鶴","Tea Monk":"茶和尚","Kite Child":"風箏孩子","Skilled":"熟練","Lantern Keeper":"燈籠守護者","Drum Major":"鼓專業","Silk Dancer":"絲綢舞者","Master":"大師","Pavilion Sage":"亭聖","Ember Herald":"餘燼先驅報","Moon Regent":"月亮攝政王","It is not your turn.":"還沒輪到你。","That action is not available right now.":"該操作目前不可用。","That float does not exist.":"此浮動不存在。","A float needs a 6 to leave the workshop.":"一個浮木需要6才能離開工坊。","That float is already crowned.":"那个浮标已经加冕了。","The roll overshoots the crown — it must fit exactly.":"辊子超出表冠 — 它必须精确贴合。","An opposing procession blocks the way.":"對面的隊伍擋住了去路。","You have a legal move, so you cannot pass.":"你有一个合法的动作，所以你不能通过。","The game is over.":"遊戲結束。","The game has moved on — refresh the state.":"遊戲繼續進行－刷新狀態。","That command is not valid.":"該命令無效。","Unknown player seat.":"未知玩家座位。","soft paper tick":"軟紙勾","wooden tok":"木托克","muted error thud":"靜音錯誤重擊","die rattle":"模具嘎嘎聲","wooden steps":"木台階","match strike and warm chime":"比賽罷工與溫暖的鈴聲","dramatic drum hit":"戏剧性的鼓声敲击","bright bell arpeggio":"亮鈴琶音","rising sparkle":"上升的火花","sad slide and poof":"悲伤的幻灯片和噗","soft breath whoosh":"轻柔的呼吸嗖嗖地响","gentle paper slide":"溫柔的紙幻燈片","festival fanfare":"節慶大張旗鼓","gentle minor cadence":"温柔的小调节奏","soft high ping":"軟高平","reverse-tape slide":"反向胶带幻灯片","Follow the lesson."